---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Our Services
permalink: /services/
description: Explore our comprehensive construction and renovation services including home renovations, custom carpentry, kitchen remodeling, and bathroom remodeling in Crestwood, KY.
breadcrumb:
  - label: Services
---

<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-3xl">From complete home renovations to custom carpentry, we deliver quality craftsmanship that stands the test of time. Explore our services below.</p>

<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    {% for service in services %}
    <a href="/services/{{ service.slug }}/" class="group block">
        <div class="bg-milwaukee-black rounded-lg overflow-hidden transform transition-transform hover:-translate-y-2">
            <div class="aspect-video relative">
                <img src="{{ service.image }}" alt="{{ service.title }}" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
            </div>
            <div class="p-8">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">{{ service.title }}</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">{{ service.shortDescription }}</p>
                <span class="text-milwaukee-red font-bold inline-flex items-center">
                    Learn More
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2 transform group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
                    </svg>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
